      "originalText": "// R1b 顺序契约写进了函数签名（instruction.rs:305）\ndispatch(ins: &Instruction, platform_ok: bool) -> Result<Dispatch, DispatchError>\n// platform_ok 必填 —— 官方 :522 平台过滤先于 :541 switch\n// 三出口：Proceed(Mode) / TargetFiltered / SkippedByDesign",
