      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// 只有 pass 计入分子 —— 门禁纪律 03 §3.3（ir.rs:498）\nVerdict::ALL: [Self; 8] = [Pass, CompilerFailure, RuntimeFailure,\n    HarnessFailure, TargetFiltered, Timeout,\n    ResourceFailure, ReferenceToolchainFailure]\nfn counts_toward_numerator(self) -> bool { self == Self::Pass }",
